 "text": "The men who survived called themselves the Chosin Few. For the rest of their lives many carried the scars of that winter. Numb fingers. Damaged feet. Memories that never thawed. Every year there are fewer of them. But the survivors still gather to remember the friends who never came home from those frozen hills.",
